    if(action==='refund'){const o=orderFor(id);if(!o||!mayTrade()||o.status!=='已支付')return;open('申请全额退款',details([['业务订单',o.id],['原实付金额',money(o.amount)],['本次退款金额',money(o.amount)]])+`<label class="field">渠道手续费返还<select id="feeReturn"><option value="true">返还（默认）</option><option value="false">不返还，由商户承担</option></select></label><label class="field" style="margin-top:16px">退款原因 <span class="required">*</span><textarea id="refundReason" required></textarea></label><div class="notice" style="margin-top:18px">已分账先回退平台服务费；不返还渠道手续费不减少客户退款金额。</div>`,B('取消','close')+B('确认全额退款','confirmRefund',id,true));return;}
